        "harmony_status": "partial",
        "remediation": "确认 OHOS NDK 的 musl 是否完整支持 sigaction/sigaltstack/SA_ONSTACK；如不支持可关闭 CATCH_CONFIG_POSIX_SIGNALS，降级为 dummy fatal condition handler。",
